.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-project-rename - Rename / recolour a project


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro project rename  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Rename / recolour a project

.PP
Send any of name, description, color, icon. The default project cannot be changed (409 \fBdefault_project\fR). Writes: 60 per minute per key (429 \fBrate_limited\fR). Sub-account keys cannot create, rename or delete projects (403 \fBsubkey_forbidden\fR).

.PP
API: PATCH /cloud/projects/{id} (operationId updateProject, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--color\fP=""
	color (gray|blue|green|red|orange|yellow|purple|pink|teal|indigo)

.PP
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--description\fP=""
	description

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for rename

.PP
\fB--icon\fP=""
	icon (folder|briefcase|building|cart3|cloud|code-slash|controller|globe2|heart|house|kanban|lightning|people|rocket-takeoff|shield-lock|shop|star|tools|truck|box-seam|mortarboard|camera)

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	Letter or digit first; then letters, digits, space and . _ - / + # & ( ). Unique per account (case-insensitive). Reserved: Genel, General, Default.

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
